<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Sampath 6-mth net up 21.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Sampath 6-mth net up 21.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1997		  1996</p>
<p>     Turnover	  1,098.18   vs	874.40</p>
<p>     Net profit	  150.22   vs	123.96</p>
<p>     Tax provision	80.89   vs	 66.74</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Sampath Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
